it's a  break change to rename `config` to `configFile` ,`configBlock` to `config`.

Maybe `config` support mixin both of `configFile` and `configBlock`?
```
## yaml code
redisson: both of support file or block
redissonFile: classpath:redisson.yaml
redissonBlock: |
#....

## java code
String config;
// hide spring data redis config...
if redisson.contains("classpath"){
config = configFile.content;
}else{
config  = configBlock;
}
```

