@mrniko  in your idea, it's a break change.  I prefer backward compatibility.

In this PR , `redisson` property should be `classpath:redisson.yaml` , `redissonBlock` property should be redisson block configuration code

Maybe  support mixin both of config:file and config:block?(Not implemented)
```
## yaml code
redisson: both of support file or block
    file: classpath:redisson.yaml
    block: |
    #....

## java code
String config;
// hide spring data redis config...
if redisson.contains("classpath"){
config = configFile.content;
}else{
config  = configBlock;
}
```

